{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00650","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 文舞 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 文舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣謩九德，真言五千。\n庆集昌胄，符开帝先。\n高文杖钺，克配彼天。\n三宗握镜，六合涣然。\n帝其承祀，率礼罔愆。\n图书雾出，日月清悬。\n舞形德类，咏谂功传。\n黄龙蜿蟺，彩云蹁跹。\n五行气顺，八佾风宣。\n介此百禄，於皇万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}